  "sourceTitle": "Cornmeal Porrige",
  "sourceText": "Cornmeal Porrige\nBy: JANICE     LAKE\nPublished: Tuesday, February 15, 2011 - 8:53am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 pound CORMEAL\n1 COCONUT\n3 leafs CINNAMON\n1 NUTMEG\n1/2 stick BUTTER\n1 tin MILK\n1/2 pound SUGAR\n1/2 teaspoon SALT\n3 teaspoons VANALLA\n\nPreparation\n\n1 GRATE COCONUT& SQUAZE IT 2 COMBINE THE MILK&CINNAMON LEAF 3 SALT NUTMEG&VANALLA 4 WHEN IT START TO BOIL IN WITH THE CORNMEAL 5 HOUR TIME SWEETEN WITH MILK &SUGAR",
